#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:72
#: 0cb101a3f8514cbdacf3d02bb6b6f49f
msgid "OCS2 Installation"
msgstr "安装 OCS2"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:74
#: 02118ef89b374fab81353ffe4b57661f
msgid "OCS2 (Optimal Control for Switched Systems) is a core dependency."
msgstr "OCS2（切换系统最优控制，Optimal Control for Switched Systems）是核心依赖。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:76
#: f21ff0c5ebb04189a79ad44f811bec40
msgid ""
"OCS2 is **not** published to Debian / ROS apt software sources. The `.deb` "
"package name is still `ros-jazzy-ocs2`. **Do not** treat `sudo apt install` "
"or a hand-run `dpkg -i` as the primary path."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 **没有**发布到 Debian / ROS apt 软件源。`.deb` 包名仍是 `ros-jazzy-ocs2`。**不要**把 "
"`sudo apt install` 或手跑 `dpkg -i` 当作主路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:78
#: dd414c6162ea4dfdb9c760e9aa0eb3c4
msgid ""
"Use the deploy-workspace scripts in `open-deploy-ws` or `fa-deploy-ws`. They"
" already switch and install OCS2 (GitHub Release `.deb` or source)."
msgstr ""
"使用 `open-deploy-ws` 或 `fa-deploy-ws` 的部署工作空间脚本。它们已经负责切换并安装 OCS2（GitHub "
"Release `.deb` 或源码）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: 6b4794d264484e548ac7c6ac3f1c6e0a
msgid ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws   # or fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws   # or fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:85
#: 2b247190d20d4fde8ac1d3329e997d32
msgid "What the script does (from the open-deploy-ws README):"
msgstr "脚本做什么（摘自 open-deploy-ws README）："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: ab19c71bd27c4adab1bbecc020880cca
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "菜单"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: 3cb072f9d3cd4e9781f1566b14c5d5dd
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: d2304ee51ade4f428d786a7bbe3d2a03
msgid "**1) 初始化工作空间**"
msgstr "**1) 初始化工作空间**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: 557285cbf6b3462189d2ef101280b3b1
msgid ""
"Nested visibility, then per-module `d` (GitHub Release `.deb`) or `s` "
"(source). OCS2 default is **deb**."
msgstr "先选嵌套可见性，再按模块选 `d`（GitHub Release `.deb`）或 `s`（源码）。OCS2 默认是 **deb**。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: 0e344c03f58c4a25b8f6ff6ec0f9894b
msgid "**2) 切换模块安装方式**"
msgstr "**2) 切换模块安装方式**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: 503dfda2b5aa4f0ab7221aae113c3675
msgid ""
"Switch an already-initialized module **source ↔ deb** (cleans conflicting "
"source or uninstalls the matching deb). Use this to change the OCS2 install "
"path."
msgstr "把已初始化模块在 **源码 ↔ deb** 之间切换（清理冲突源码或卸载对应 deb）。用这个改 OCS2 安装路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: e9503fcae64445c789a9a177adaea0e1
msgid "**3) 仅安装/更新核心 deb**"
msgstr "**3) 仅安装/更新核心 deb**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: b3e291988ff0443591c5f7213f4503dd
msgid "Skip Git; e.g. `./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"
msgstr "跳过 Git；例如 `./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: 075699289d3b4865b95bd8115124297b
msgid "**4) 卸载核心 deb**"
msgstr "**4) 卸载核心 deb**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: fa945e7997d848f1b835e4dc4bd92adc
msgid "e.g. `./scripts/uninstall_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"
msgstr "例如 `./scripts/uninstall_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: baf4416d61c14f3098d945e3afc7bf4a
msgid "**5) 仅运行 rosdep**"
msgstr "**5) 仅运行 rosdep**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:80
#: 7ae469ff977745ccb2f2767533fa6856
msgid "`rosdep install` on `src/` only"
msgstr "只对 `src/` 跑 `rosdep install`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:95
#: 9dbbd7c1b2da4b1597a569daa369cc25
msgid ""
"Choosing `d` downloads the matching GitHub Release asset via "
"`scripts/install_core_debs.sh`. It does **not** install from "
"packages.ros.org. After init, you still `colcon build`."
msgstr ""
"选 `d` 会通过 `scripts/install_core_debs.sh` 下载匹配的 GitHub Release 资源。**不会**从 "
"packages.ros.org 安装。init 之后仍需 `colcon build`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:97
#: 46fb6479d45e4e2b8d92ed0f62388b7f
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:100
#: 3eae542b48c74ea783d85361aac8f5b3
msgid ""
"Only if you are not using a deploy workspace. Download the matching asset "
"for your architecture and ROS distro from [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) (filename pattern "
"`ros-jazzy-ocs2_*_<arch>.deb`), then `sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb` and"
" `sudo apt-get install -f` if dpkg reports missing dependencies. For source:"
" clone branch `ros2` into `src/` — or choose `s` in `./init_repo.sh`."
msgstr ""
"仅当你没有使用部署工作空间时。从 [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) 下载匹配架构和 ROS "
"发行版的资源（文件名形如 `ros-jazzy-ocs2_*_<arch>.deb`），然后 `sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-"
"ocs2_*.deb`；若 dpkg 报缺依赖再 `sudo apt-get install -f`。源码：把 `ros2` 分支克隆进 `src/` "
"— 或在 `./init_repo.sh` 里选 `s`。"

