#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:111
#: 33a8e60207624e028cdbd57fcc9b280d
msgid "Isaac Sim"
msgstr "Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:113
#: c6bed492867c4e579de84179be3035f2
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** scripts. Path and version live in config, not in a "
"hardcoded minor version in these docs."
msgstr "使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 脚本。路径和版本写在配置里，不要在这些文档里写死某一个次版本号。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:115
#: cbc9bb566b814ab9897dd1806943ccf6
msgid ""
"Default install directory: `ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim` unless you set it in"
" `config/fa_sim.local.conf` or the environment)"
msgstr ""
"默认安装目录：`ISAACSIM_DIR`（除非在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 或环境变量里设置，否则为 "
"`~/isaacsim`）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:116
#: ff709b08f7544d858538f251a2fcaabc
msgid ""
"Optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace version: `./init.sh` operation 2 menu "
"(queries GitHub stable tags; fallback list in `config/fa_sim.conf` currently"
" `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`). Override with `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`"
msgstr ""
"可选 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间版本：`./init.sh` 操作 2 菜单（查询 GitHub 稳定 tag；回退列表见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`，目前是 `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`）。用 `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=…"
" ./init.sh` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:118
#: 602010487cf94ff58bc2c55aa782847b
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh    # 1) submodules  2) optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace\n"
"./run.sh     # menu: PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh    # 1) submodules  2) optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace\n"
"./run.sh     # menu: PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:125
#: cb919b87a8e341589afdf5ab3e9de9a1
