msgid ""
"This applies to packages that **are** in the ROS apt index (for example "
"`ros-jazzy-desktop`). It does **not** apply to OCS2."
msgstr "这适用于**确实**在 ROS apt 索引中的包（例如 `ros-jazzy-desktop`）。它**不适用于** OCS2。"

