#: a51f897604734328a6b5c11a4cbc7b99
msgid ""
"Re-run `./init_repo.sh` in the deploy workspace: choose **1** and `d` for "
"OCS2, or **3** (`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`). To change an "
"existing install, use menu **2) 切换模块安装方式**."
msgstr ""
"在部署工作空间再跑 `./init_repo.sh`：选 **1** 并为 OCS2 选 `d`，或选 "
"**3**（`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`）。要改已有安装，用菜单 **2) "
"切换模块安装方式**。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:211
#: f7d50f0f8359451aad1f1cc00c04084b
msgid ""
"dpkg-query -W ros-jazzy-ocs2\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
msgstr ""
"dpkg-query -W ros-jazzy-ocs2\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"

